  Live note: the throughput series is client-accumulated from the 5s-refetched status deltas
  (web throughputHistory), folded by ThroughputAccumulator over the shared state upstream.
  Units: MQTT status carries counts (signals, batches), a rate (signals/sec) and uptime seconds —
  none are user-preference units, so the page performs NO SI conversion (the web renders these raw
  too); only en-US grouping/precision is applied at the display boundary (parity contract).

